{"id":21053,"name":"愿旅途永远坦然","rarity":4,"path":"Knight","desc":"存护命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","story":"男孩在如星的雨滴中奔跑，为那久旱之后的甘霖欢呼。\\n\\n那一场雨下了很久很久，大篷车停驻在遍布绿意的土地。\\n<i>「母亲，姐姐，我们不会再挨饿受冻了！」\\n</i>埃维金人的篝火温暖了漫长的夜，男孩听着姐姐的故事，等待着晨曦。\\n\\n<i>「卡卡瓦夏，你也会带着母神恩赐的幸运，去做到我们做不到的事…愿你的旅途永远坦然，诡计永不败露……」</i>\\n\\n金色的阳光从梦中倒映在现实的居所，交易与数字再次映入眼帘。\\n他松开紧握的手——\\n\\n仿佛什么也没能抓住，又仿佛还有余温跳动。","max_promotion":6,"max_rank":5,"skill":{"id":21053,"name":"甜梦","desc":"使装备者提供的护盾量提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#1[i]%</unbreak></color>，我方目标持有护盾时，造成的伤害提高<color=#f29e38ff><unbreak>#2[i]%</unbreak></color>。","level":{"1":{"level":1,"param_list":[0.12,0.12]},"2":{"level":2,"param_list":[0.15,0.14]},"3":{"level":3,"param_list":[0.18,0.16]},"4":{"level":4,"param_list":[0.21,0.18]},"5":{"level":5,"param_list":[0.24,0.2]}}},"stats":{"0":{"hp_base":48,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":16.8,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":24,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":20,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":4000},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":5}]},"1":{"hp_base":105.6,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":36.96,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":52.8,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":30,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":8000},{"ItemID":110211,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":114011,"ItemNum":10}]},"2":{"hp_base":182.4,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":63.84,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":91.2,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":40,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":16000},{"ItemID":110212,"ItemNum":3},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":6}]},"3":{"hp_base":259.2,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":90.72,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":129.6,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":50,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":40000},{"ItemID":110212,"ItemNum":6},{"ItemID":114012,"ItemNum":9}]},"4":{"hp_base":336,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":117.6,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":168,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":60,"cost":[{"ItemID":2,"ItemNum":80000},{"ItemID":110213,"ItemNum":4},{"ItemID":114013,"ItemNum":5}]},"5":{"hp_base":412.8,"hp_add":7.2,"attack_base":144.48,"attack_add":2.52,"defence_base":206.4,"defence_add":3.6,"max_level":70,"cost":[{"It